+
+Request: implement JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386) as `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`.
+
+Done: non-object patch replaces the target; object patch merges recursively, `null` members delete,
+non-object targets are treated as `{}`; inputs are not mutated; `__proto__` is an ordinary member.
+Tests: `test/mergepatch.test.ts` (RFC appendix A examples plus no-mutation / `__proto__`). `npm test` passes.
